# The script host's smoke run (docs/phase-script.md, stage SC2): a game's first view, the camera, the pause, the game
# menu by its key and closed by its Return to Game button. tools/ci.sh wants exit code 0 and "0 failures".
mission terran/terran01
options originals
clock real

wait game
wait frames 10
shot start
log start tick camera.x camera.y
mark start
camera 1200 1400
wait frames 2
expect camera.x != @start.camera.x
log moved camera.x camera.y
pause
wait paused within 1000
resume
wait tick > @start.tick + 8
key F10
wait dialog gamemenu
shot menu
click control gamemenu.return
wait nodialog
shot end
